[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8899.69, "timestamp": "02:28:19", "text": "嗯，這是一幅畫，對吧？好的，我畫完了。嘿，還有東西，哪個？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8919.67, "timestamp": "02:28:39", "text": "這個？ [音樂] 一個，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8923.86, "timestamp": "02:28:43", "text": "為什麼要留著你？然後是M，我…[音樂] 留著…"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8939.19, "timestamp": "02:28:59", "text": "我該留在"}]